************************************************************************
	Imagine a world without boundaries and limitations.
	That world is Casimirage.
************************************************************************

The only commands in this growing mudlib are:
	dest, goto, update, ed, echo, eval, efun, rm, say, speak,
	who, ipwho, whoami, worldecho, clone, walk, look, ql, 
	quit, and shutdown.
Update, dest, clone, goto, ed, and rm require full pathnames as arguments.
Have fun.

